    "detailed_description": "<strong>EDDIE HILL in The Curse of the Skull Medallion</strong><br>is an hardcore platformer inspired by  the modern classics of the genre.<br><br>In this adventure, Eddie must retrieve the Skull Medallion sitting atop a mountain walled by a perilous jungle and an ancient temple full of dangers.<br><br>The levels in this game were designed by students during a level design workshop I held  in March 2021.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>16 levels split in 3 worlds.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>Collectibles<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>A SpeedRun mode.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>Loads of deaths<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>Spikes<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1600020/extras/1c7621a187d87cd6bbde3f5e79d4b1fb.webp?t=1727943588\" /></div>Bad jokes",
